{'symbol': 'WEC', 'date': '2023-01-31 08:00:00', 'title': 'WEC ENERGY GROUP TO ACQUIRE 80% OWNERSHIP OF SAMSON I SOLAR ENERGY CENTER', 'text': 'MILWAUKEE , JAN. 31, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WEC ENERGY GROUP (NYSE: WEC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY HAS AGREED TO ACQUIRE AN 80% OWNERSHIP INTEREST IN THE SAMSON I SOLAR ENERGY CENTER. SAMSON I IS A 250-MEGAWATT PROJECT LOCATED ABOUT 140 MILES NORTHEAST OF DALLAS, TEXAS.'}